{"title": "Bliss Spores (Condition)", "pageid": 11059, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bliss_Spores_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bliss Spores Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Bliss_Spores_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bliss Spores</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity has a +1d6 bonus to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack Roll Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attacks\" title=\"Attacks\">Attack Rolls</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Abilities#Ability_checks\" title=\"Abilities\">Ability Checks</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Saving throws</a> until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Resting#Long_Rest\" title=\"Resting\">Long Rest</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BLISS_SPORES</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBLISS_SPORES%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CBLISS_SPORES%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Granted as a quest reward from <a href=\"/wiki/Defeat_the_Duergar_Intruders\" title=\"Defeat the Duergar Intruders\">Defeat the Duergar Intruders</a>.\n<ul><li>Informing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/25px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/38px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/50px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sovereign Spaw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png/25px-Portrait_Spaw.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Portrait_Spaw.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spaw\" title=\"Spaw\">Sovereign Spaw</a> of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/38px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/50px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glut's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png/25px-Portrait_Glut.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Glut.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glut\" title=\"Glut\">Glut's</a> betrayal before telling him about the duergar's deaths does not result in the player being rewarded with Bliss Spores.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Similar to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bardic Inspiration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d3/Bardic_Inspiration_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(Condition)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (Condition)\">Bardic Inspiration</a>, this condition provides significant bonuses across the board. It survives respeccing with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> and moving between <a href=\"/wiki/Region\" title=\"Region\">Regions</a>, as well as <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>. As such, it may be advisable to either refrain from defeating <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/25px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/38px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/50px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gekh Coal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png/25px-Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Portrait_Gekh_Coal.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\">Gekh Coal</a> (and, therefore, removing <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nere%27s_Head\" title=\"Nere's Head\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Nere%27s_Head_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Nere%27s_Head\" title=\"Nere's Head\">Nere's Head</a>) or delay speaking to Spaw afterwards to save the Bliss Spores condition for anticipated situations of considerable challenge.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205425\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.065 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2498/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23082/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10481/4194304 bytes\nH